  "implementation": [
    "Project-owned Erlang uri_string module exports parse/1, normalize/1, recompose/1, resolve/3; preserve map/list/binary representations, percent quoting, IPv6, dot segments and RFC relative resolution.",
    "IR stores lexical protection for calls and potentially raising operations; codegen no longer infers protection from a later guard or catch.",
    "Map pattern compilation checks key presence before extraction, selecting the next clause on an absent key.",
    "Harness prefers gmake, explicitly builds all and rejects missing BEAM modules before executing differential cases."
  ],
